<section class="tiers-section">
  <div class="tiers-inner">
    <div class="tiers-header">
      <h2>Everything Your Small Business Needs — One Package</h2>
      <p>No choosing between features. Get the full AI automation stack built to stop missing leads.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="packages-grid">
      <!-- SMB BUNDLE — lead entry point, first position -->
      <div class="package-card package-card--smb">
        <div class="package-badge--smb">Best Value</div>
        <div class="package-tier">SMB Bundle</div>
        <div class="package-price">$149<span class="package-price-sub">/month</span></div>
        <div class="package-monthly">Monthly subscription</div>
        <p class="package-desc">Everything your small business needs to stop missing leads — one simple package. No choosing between features.</p>
        <ul class="package-features">
          <li>AI chatbot (lead capture + qualification)</li>
          <li>AI voice receptionist (call handling + routing)</li>
          <li>Email auto-responders</li>
          <li>Scheduling automation</li>
          <li>Basic CRM workflows</li>
          <li>3 integrations</li>
          <li>Monthly performance report</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/signup?plan=smb-bundle" class="btn-primary">Sign Up -></a>
      </div>

      <!-- STARTER -->
      <div class="package-card">
        <div class="package-tier">Starter</div>
        <div class="package-price">$299<span class="package-price-sub">/month</span></div>
        <p class="package-desc">Instantly captures every web lead and missed call — never lose a prospect to voicemail again.</p>
        <ul class="package-features">
          <li>AI voice receptionist (answers, responds, qualifies)</li>
          <li>Instant SMS reply to missed calls</li>
          <li>Web chat widget — captures visitors 24/7</li>
          <li>Lead notification to your phone</li>
          <li>Call logging &amp; CRM entry</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/signup?plan=starter" class="btn-outline">Start with Starter -></a>
      </div>

      <!-- PROFESSIONAL -->
      <div class="package-card package-card--featured">
        <div class="package-badge">Most Popular</div>
        <div class="package-tier">Professional</div>
        <div class="package-price">$599<span class="package-price-sub">/month</span></div>
        <p class="package-desc">Everything in Starter, plus AI-powered scheduling and follow-up that turns leads into booked jobs.</p>
        <ul class="package-features">
          <li>Everything in Starter, plus:</li>
          <li>AI booking — syncs to your calendar</li>
          <li>Automated appointment reminders</li>
          <li>Post-job follow-up &amp; review requests</li>
          <li>Google Business Message integration</li>
          <li>Priority support &amp; monthly check-in</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/signup?plan=professional" class="btn-primary">Start Professional -></a>
      </div>

      <!-- ENTERPRISE -->
      <div class="package-card">
        <div class="package-tier">Enterprise</div>
        <div class="package-price">$1,199<span class="package-price-sub">/month</span></div>
        <p class="package-desc">Full AI system for multi-location operations — handles scheduling, rebooking, and client comms at scale.</p>
        <ul class="package-features">
          <li>Everything in Professional, plus:</li>
          <li>Full AI voice agent (no call flows, no menus)</li>
          <li>Multi-location support</li>
          <li>Custom CRM integration</li>
          <li>Dedicated onboarding &amp; quarterly review</li>
          <li>SLA guarantee — 99.5% call answer rate</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/signup?plan=enterprise" class="btn-outline">Get Enterprise -></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<% /* Trust bar just above CTA */ %>
<div class="trust-bar">
  <div class="trust-bar-inner">
    <div class="trust-item">
      <span class="trust-icon">⚡</span>
      <span class="trust-label">Setup in 20 minutes</span>
    </div>
    <div class="trust-item">
      <span class="trust-icon">✕</span>
      <span class="trust-label">First month minimum, then month-to-month</span>
    </div>
    <div class="trust-item">
      <span class="trust-icon">☎</span>
      <span class="trust-label">Captures 95%+ of missed calls</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<% /* Trust bar styles */ %>
<style>
.trust-bar {
  padding: 0 24px 80px;
  background: var(--bg);
}
.trust-bar-inner {
  max-width: var(--max-w);
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  gap: 0;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  border-radius: 14px;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: var(--bg-card);
}
.trust-bar .trust-item {
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 10px;
  padding: 22px 20px;
  border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  font-size: 0.92rem;
  color: var(--fg-muted);
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-weight: 500;
}
.trust-bar .trust-item:last-child { border-right: none; }
.trust-bar .trust-icon { font-size: 1.1rem; }
.trust-bar .trust-label { line-height: 1.3; }
</style>

<section class="closing">
  <div class="closing-inner">
    <h2>Every missed call is a missed customer.<br>We make sure that stops.</h2>
    <p class="closing-sub">Autovyne exists because local businesses deserve the same AI firepower as the big guys. We're building the automation layer that turns every lead into a conversation, and every conversation into revenue.</p>
    <div class="closing-actions">
      <a href="/signup" class="btn-primary btn-large">Start Signup -></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
